WEBVTT

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:13.300
This is my first invitation from Persia!
I'll make sure it's a success!

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.370
Hasuki?

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.960
-What are you peeking into my room for?
-Inuzuka!

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.330
Romio.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.470
W-Why?

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.220
Why is my brother Airu here?

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.720
The student rep suddenly forced
his way into your room...

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:45.280
He's the head of the famous Inuzuka family.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.270
Astoundingly powerful and strict,
he keeps the Black Doggy House in line

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:49.700
Airu Inuzuka
Black Doggy House Representative Prefect

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.740
as the representative prefect.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.240
He's also Inuzuka's older brother.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:35.840
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:44.690
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:50.690
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:56.030
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:01.200
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.960
So that I can protect you

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:10.460
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:16.010
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:21.060
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:28.020
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.500
Romio and Airu

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.860
Inuzuka, you usually don't
talk about your brother at all.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:40.510
What's got you this scared?

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.010
Romio.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.140
What is this? Where did you get it?

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:54.020
Why would you have something like this?

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.870
I can't tell him it was a present from Persia.
What should I do?

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.420
Sorry...

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:06.290
Airu overheard us chewing the fat
over why you'd have a rosary.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:09.510
That's a present for me.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:13.670
I'd been going on about how I wanted
something shiny, so he bought whatever he could find.

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:15.730
Hasuki!

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:19.670
Then how do you explain this?
Where'd you get this?

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.510
The bra I got from Char!

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.050
That's news to me. Whose is that?

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:30.270
I've been abandoned.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.270
That's not all.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:36.540
Lately you've been acting strange.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:42.200
You wouldn't happen to be colluding
with a White Cats girl?

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.800
Touwa and the West
have a precarious relationship.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:52.460
Our superficial peace treaty
could crumble at any moment.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:01.190
If in the midst of this, you're in
communication with an enemy female,

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.110
you'd be branded as a traitor.

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:08.200
If you let the Inuzuka family's influence
come tumbling down for that,

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.780
I'd expel you from the school.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.890
No. Even from the Inuzuka family.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.750
You don't have the authority--

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.270
Hasuki Komai.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.670
Why have you been standing up for Romio?

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:23.660
Are you an accomplice?

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.130
Hasuki has nothing to do with this.
And I'm not colluding!

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.540
Believe me, brother!

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.540
Believe you?

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.600
How can I believe a troublemaker like you?

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.730
Do you realize how many times I've covered for you?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.990
Let go, Teria.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.810
This is between two siblings.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.950
It doesn't involve you, Teria.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:57.060
I can't breathe...

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.960
Airu! Now you're just being violent!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.190
Get off my shoulder.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.000
You may be siblings, but this is a school!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.510
Keep it up and I will have to punish you!

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.400
Then we'll go with this...

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.830
You'll be under surveillance for a week.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.850
If my doubts are alleviated, you'll be set free.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:25.720
While you're at it,
take some time to fix that attitude of yours.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.570
A week...

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.100
Persia's birthday!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.270
Would you celebrate my birthday with me?

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.120
I'd like you to take

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.520
a little more pride in being
the second son of the Inuzuka family.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:54.410
What now?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.710
They're done.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.970
What do you think, Miss Kitchen Maid?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.570
Yes...

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.360
They certainly don't appear to be out of sorts.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.240
Then I've just got to taste them.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.540
Please, allow me to be the poison tester--

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.670
Poison tester?

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.970
They're good!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:34.720
You might even call this a perfect cookie!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.550
Thanks for showing me the ropes!

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:39.390
Not at all.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:42.910
These are the results of your hard work.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:48.690
You withdrew from your social life,
and practiced every day for this.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.020
Okay, I'm ready.

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.330
They're quite good!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.000
Really? Thank goodness.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:09.250
Lady Persia's leftover homemade cookies!

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.840
This unworthy soul has felt bliss

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:15.510
and may just ascend to heaven here and now!

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.590
So, what spurred this?

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.100
I can't imagine you practicing making cookies.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.170
What do you mean?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:27.310
Well... I was really bad at cooking, right?

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.940
I thought I should at least learn to bake cookies...

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.930
It was Inuzuka, wasn't it?

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.990
I'm sure you planned to give them
to him on your birthday.

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:40.070
No, that's not true!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:41.660
Oh, no?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.500
Maybe I'll slip some sleeping pills into them.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.790
Hey. Isn't that Inuzuka
with the student rep over there?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.450
The student rep is as majestic as ever today.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.930
Oh, this is a rare sight.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:02.010
Inuzuka together with the prefects?

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:05.610
I'm sure he caused some trouble
and is being punished as a result.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:08.400
Serves him right, doesn't it, Lady Persia?

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.470
He's not his usual self.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:15.470
He seems afraid of something.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.950
Hey, Romio.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:21.480
-What is it?
-Do you not get along with Airu?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.330
Big sis. That's pretty forward of you.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:31.210
It's just Airu is usually so coolheaded.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:34.550
He's only ever been this angry with
the White Cats student rep.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:37.050
Whenever Airu administers punishment,

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:41.560
he doesn't hold back, no matter the dorm.
But normally...

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:44.120
-Sorry!
-Student rep!

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:53.260
-Sorry, sorry! We're sorry!
-Please forgive us!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.510
-It powered up!
-It powered up!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.900
-Awesome!
-Thank you very much!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.740
Play in a more open area.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.280
-Okay!
-Okay!

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.270
He's awkward, but he can be kind.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.580
To the students, sure.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.780
He's never once shown me any kindness.

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.780
He's disciplined me harshly since we were young.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:21.290
If I was bad, I was spanked until I cried.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:25.050
To me, my brother was traumatizing.

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.920
He's like a huge wall.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.690
You should be able to solve this.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:39.750
What have you been doing up until now?
You've lived without purpose.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.430
That's exactly why you're useless.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:47.230
Do I start from the outside? Or was it the inside?

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:52.370
A second son of the Inuzuka family
spends five minutes or less on the toilet.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:53.740
I can't go...

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:37.130
You took kendo your first year, right? Come.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.320
I'll train you personally.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:45.330
From the way things are going,
it looks like he'll avoid getting expelled.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:50.140
Still, I'd rather not see Inuzuka
looking like that, though.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.590
-I'll just wait for tomorr--
-Tomorrow has finally come!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.410
-Yeah!
-It's tomorrow!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.980
As you know, July 1st,

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.090
the day of Lady Persia's birth, approaches!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:06.610
The success of tomorrow's
birthday party depends on us!

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:09.910
Let's make a cake
bigger than the school building!

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.110
Yeah!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.240
Get up. Your training isn't over.

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:32.890
Get up.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:38.320
Get up.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:42.480
He's usually selfish and arrogant,

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:47.080
but he keeps his mouth shut in front of
the student rep. This is refreshing.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:50.840
Looks like his spirit's been completely broken.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:53.490
I can't handle the student rep either.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.580
He's terrifying.

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.810
You okay, Inuzuka?

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:07.720
I was surprised.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:10.010
The White Cats were causing a stir

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:13.270
about tomorrow being Persia's birthday.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.070
I thought you'd try to disobey the student rep,

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.690
but I'm glad you stayed in line.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.610
You must lay low until the surveillance--

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.480
Did it look like I was staying in line?

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.780
Then I'd call it a success.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.180
I've been trying to hold out these last few days

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.190
to get my brother to drop his guard.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.910
So you really are planning to see Persia.
If you're caught, you'll be expelled!

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.820
It's okay. I won't cause problems for you.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:46.270
It's not about me! What I'm worried about

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:49.080
is not having you around at school.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.470
I don't want that.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.460
I promise that won't happen.

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:03.110
Inuzuka...

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:05.530
I'm going to wash my face.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.040
Stupid Inuzuka.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.600
What's going on?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.360
Persia!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.370
Tell me.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.990
Why would Inuzuka be expelled?

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:30.050
I know you're worried about me.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:31.840
But I'm sorry, Hasuki.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:34.870
It might look like just a regular birthday to you.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:37.730
But to me...

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.880
We're to meet in front of the fountain at 11.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:44.810
My brother should be in bed by now.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:46.380
The next patrol comes in an hour.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:51.390
I have to meet with Persia, celebrate,
and then return within an hour.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.140
It's okay. I can pull this off.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:57.530
I've never defied my brother before.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.720
Before, my spirit would have been totally broken.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.720
But it's different now.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:06.210
I can summon up strength and courage for Persia.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:08.410
Where are you going? Get back here.

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:17.920
Brother. You're not asleep?

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:22.720
I knew you were plotting something.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.670
You feigned complete repentance,

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:28.760
while your eyes revealed your true determination.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:33.240
I've seen through you, little brother.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:35.600
It's forbidden to leave the grounds after curfew.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:37.730
Come back.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.420
N-No.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.290
Then what will you do?

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.350
Try to defy me?

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.360
Have you ever beaten me in a sibling scuffle?

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.800
Do you even possess the courage to defy me?

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.880
It seems you do possess the courage.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.600
But you're weak.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:17.450
Don't think, just stand and fight!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:41.730
Damn it...

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.230
This view reminds me of

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.770
the good old days.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:53.320
You haven't grown at all.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.240
Take a while and cool your head.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.140
We'll talk later.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.150
Ouch...

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:09.470
I guess I'm no match in my current state.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.650
But...

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.730
If I'm not alone,

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.130
I can escape!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.300
Airu went back to the dorm.

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.920
It's just like you said, Romio.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.500
My brother's always

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:30.090
locked me in a shed as punishment
until I reflected on my actions.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:34.330
He probably thinks I'm throwing a fit in here.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:37.640
Goodness. You're really overdoing this.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:42.520
What? Help you face off against Airu?!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.830
What's this about?

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.150
You're too loud!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:50.720
I need to get free and clear of the dorm
for just two hours.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:53.460
But it's impossible to get away
without being caught.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.550
He'll shut me in a room to reflect for sure.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.910
Then there's no way--

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.910
But while I'm locked up,
he'll surely let his guard down.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.610
You want us to free you from there?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.970
That's the only way to get away from my brother.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.800
You're the only ones I can rely on. Please.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:17.230
We've got no obligation to help.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.810
What are you even gonna do once you're free?

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:22.160
I want to

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.440
help you.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.190
What?

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.250
No matter how much you like Romio,
you can't just--

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.740
It's not that I like him.

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:36.180
Prefects are supposed
to protect and guide the students.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.950
Right now,

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.220
Romio is trying to climb a wall of his own.

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.710
So I

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:47.670
want to help him get over that wall.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.600
Thank you! You really are a good person!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:53.920
Let go of me.

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:56.020
Thank you!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.320
-Fine. I'll help you out too.
-Let go!

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.410
You mean it?!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.860
Teria's always relied on me,

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:07.910
never giving her own opinion...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.790
Thanks to you,
I can dodge his surveillance for a bit.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:13.960
In exchange,

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:18.450
you'll be weeding the schoolyard
as punishment for breaking curfew!

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.950
All that aside,

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.260
if we're caught, we won't get off so easily either.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:29.260
I don't know what you're up to,
but you'd better make it quick.

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.460
Thanks. I owe you guys.

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:37.650
He's beaten up pretty badly.
Shouldn't he get treated?

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:46.480
I finally get to see Persia.
I can wish her happy birthday.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:50.370
I've always... Always wanted to say it.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.630
Wanted to celebrate with her.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:56.460
I'd always wondered why I couldn't be at her side.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.850
But it's different now.

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.690
I can say happy birthday.

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.770
I can be next to her. I can see her smile.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.300
I'm happy.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.920
So very happy.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.920
I have to get there quick.

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.670
What? What the--?

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.180
That's odd.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.180
My strength is fading.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:28.030
I can't move my body.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:31.940
Give me a break. Not here.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.940
Damn it...

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.800
Persia?

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:50.300
Why are you here? We were supposed to meet

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:52.470
at the fountain.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:55.840
I came to stop you.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:20:00.340
But it seems I'm too late.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:05.030
Your brother was monitoring you because

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:08.220
he suspected your relationship with me.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:10.490
And if he found out, you'd be expelled.

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:11.850
How did you know?

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:15.210
I asked Hasuki about it.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.680
You really weren't prepared for this?

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:23.630
You didn't realize how irregular your existence was?

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:27.180
What a fine, thorny line you'd be walking?!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.630
Inuzuka...

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:32.140
walked that thorny path,

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.290
not caring how badly he'd be scarred.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:39.930
It's frustrating, but my voice can't reach him now.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:43.360
There's only one that can...

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:47.440
Don't make that face.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.530
He was joking about the expulsion.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.160
The present.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:54.310
-It's not ready yet, but I'll definitely--
-I don't want it.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.500
It's only because I yearned
to be with you

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.630
that you were hurt so badly.

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:13.720
Much more than some present, I want...

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:18.880
I want to see you in good health.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:23.190
Persia...

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.360
No matter what happens, I'll protect you.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:31.620
That's what I'd decided.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.220
I'm so

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:36.200
sorry.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:41.340
As long as our relationship continues,
Inuzuka will--

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:43.800
Why are you apologizing?

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.600
You don't have to apologize.

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:48.760
The two of us

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:51.790
have nothing to feel guilty about!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.720
Am I wrong?

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:03.190
I'm sorry.

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:33.720
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:41.730
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:49.030
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:22:49.190 --> 00:22:55.660
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:56.830 --> 00:23:03.880
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:10.220
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:17.470
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.680
I want to support you

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:27.520
With everything I have

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:35.620
Until the world can one day change

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:40.400
Romio, about that bra I found in your room.

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:44.770
It was white with a cat symbol on it.
The size was a C-cup. It was a silk fabric--

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.790
-Brother?!
-It was even sag-resistant.

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:48.420
Why do you know all the details?!

00:23:48.420 --> 00:23:48.690
Next time, "Romio and Juliet and the Birthday."

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:52.030
Romio and Juliet and the Birthday
